+# Version Numbering Scheme
+
+This project has no recorded decision on a version numbering scheme. A search of the repository's documentation (README.md, CONTRIBUTING.md, CHANGELOG.md, docs/doc.md) and CI/release configuration turned up no statement specifying or adopting a versioning policy (e.g., SemVer or any other scheme), so none is documented here.
